        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage F62CAM, Traditional Camelot Double Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe distinctive design of the Camelot combines architectural inspired arches with graceful curves. The two-piece design offers flexibility for doors with non-standard hole locations while providing a classic appearance for smaller entranceways. A fine example for the legendary quality and reliability Schlage has come to be known for, it is made with a rugged all-metal chassis for added security. What is more, the Camelot Handleset is gorgeous, featuring beveled edged mounting plates that look great for traditional styled homes. A double cylinder handleset, it is operated by a key on both the interior and exterior; and the latchbolt is operated by a turnknob inside and a thumbpiece outside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Double Cylinder Handleset:</b> The deadbolt on this double cylinder handleset is thrown or retracted by a key from the both the exterior and the interior. The latch is retracted by a thumbpiece from the exterior and by a turn knob on the interior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: <br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/camelot-single-cylinder-handleset-schlage-f60cam\"><b>Camelot Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/camelot-dummy-handleset-schlage-f93cam\"><b>Camelot Dummy Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Camelot Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.5 Grade 1 security.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>All metal chassis for strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>3 screw door frame reinforcer.</li>\r\n<li>Guaranteed to fit all standard door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>C keyway comes packaged with 2 keys.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Double Cylinder Camelot Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Outside Handle Length: 12-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Handle Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: will fit 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>5-1/2\" center to center deadbolt to latch spacing</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable throughbolt can move up and down 1-1/2\" to fit a variety of pre-existing holes</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: will fit 1-5/8\" up to 1-3/4\" packaged with extra screws to accommodate 2\" doors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset finish</i.>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Camelot Double Cylinder Handleset Schlage F62CAM",
                "description": "Schlage F62CAM Camelot Double Cylinder Handleset - The distinctive design of the Camelot combines architectural inspired arches with graceful curves. The two-piece design offers flexibility for doors with non-standard hole locations while providing a classic appearance for smaller entranceways. A fine example for the legendary quality and reliability Schlage has come to be known for, it is made with a rugged all-metal chassis for added security. What is more, the Camelot Handleset is gorgeous, featuring beveled edged mounting plates that look great for traditional styled homes. A double cylinder handleset, it is operated by a key on both the interior and exterior; and the latchbolt is operated by a turnknob inside and a thumbpiece outside.",
